    Bug 2017419 - Implement deltas in ms_graph_tb. r=edicharry

    This moves responsibility for the endpoint configuration from the
    client to being a part of the path template, else we end up with a
    confusing division between requests where the caller is expected to
    add it after the fact, and requests like pagination and deltas where
    the MS docs warn against modifying the entire link returned.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D284167

